  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving Coffee Productivity for Better Farmer Livelihoods in Bushenyi</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The grant from USADF will support the cooperative to recruit new members to reach 800 coffee farmers thereby increasing the number of farmer Members to supply coffee. These farmers will supply coffee to be processed and sold by the cooperative.</narrative>
